## 2) Extra emit-c / check probes (6.1 re-prove, not a landed smoke)
Ephemeral fixtures: `/tmp/s61_integration/probes/` (not repo root). Same host ELF.

| Probe | emit-c | check | SECRET? |
|-------|--------|-------|---------|
| `env_set(envc, token)` `// SECRET: token` (2-arg key) | rc=1 `ERR\tsecret\tenv_set sink refuses SECRET token` | rc=1 `ERR\ttype\tundefined variable 'env_set'` | emit **TP** |
| `env_set(envc, public)` unused SECRET `token` | rc=1 `unknown free call … env_set` (**no** `ERR secret`) | type undefined | emit **no FP**; unlowered |
| `env_set(envc, "KEY", token)` SECRET value | rc=1 `ERR\tsecret\tenv_set sink refuses SECRET token` | type undefined | emit **TP** |
| `env_set(envc, "KEY", "public")` unused SECRET | rc=1 `unknown free call … env_set` (no secret) | type undefined | emit **no FP**; unlowered |
| `env_set(envc, "token")` string-lit spelling | rc=1 unknown-call (no secret) | — | emit **no FP** |
| `fixtures/secret_setenv_fail.oo` | rc=1 `ERR\tsecret\tsetenv sink refuses SECRET token` | type undefined `setenv` | emit **TP** |
| `fixtures/secret_setenv_pass.oo` | rc=1 `unknown free call … setenv` (no secret) | type undefined | emit **no FP** |
| `fixtures/secret_env_get_fail.oo` (control, lowered) | rc=1 `ERR\tsecret\tenv_get sink refuses SECRET token` | — | emit **TP** (product op) |
| `let f = env_set; f(envc, token)` | **rc=134 abort** `oo_vemalloc(): unaligned tcache chunk detected` | — | **not** a 6.1 rail; host heap residual |
| `let f = env_set; f(envc, "KEY", token)` | **rc=134** same abort | — | same |

`timeout 15s` on both alias probes; both dumped core. Integration **does not** claim alias-to-`env_set` is green. `c_secret_is_sink_name` lists the name; live alias emit did not reach a printed `ERR secret`.

`secret_sink_enforce_smoke.oo` will rail `secret_setenv_{fail,pass}` when present. **Allow** `setenv` cannot be emit-OK until a lower exists — not run as an assigned 6.1 gate this pass.

